// For a panel that is its own window and should open on ONE monitor only (the one with the focus, or the one
// you clicked on), not on every monitor. The scene's surface is `screens: each`; this part gives it the fact
// `open_screen` (set by topbar.luau just before it toggles the panel) and `here` (this copy is that monitor).
// The scene gates its main group with `show: here`, its dismiss zone with `active: open and here`, and any
// `keyboard: … while` with `open and open_screen == screen.index`.
part Here {
    fact open_screen = 0
    let here = open_screen == screen.index
}
